{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Omenzia...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an elder woman with a dark past in search for her missing family amidst a vampire dictatorship, the Blood Junta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/ecac81ae7f3eeee3797c596b640df37c.avif?t=1762481045\" width=363 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A city run by blood-suckers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your criminal records and return from exile to Bah\u00eda Blanca, a city on the verge of civil strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/8887bcfc274e42284cfc8e87f3dd763b.avif?t=1762481045\" width=1095 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you join the revolution?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Junta opresses humanity with the Blood Tribute, indebting them with their own life-force, but the Dead Hand revolutionaries seek to throw down their dominion by any means necessary. Will you join them or give them away to save what you hold dearest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/cd83d3a899d38879c20c53b0d2da42ae.avif?t=1762481045\" width=699 height=851 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144100?t=1762481045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/0f312f7ed66a134b772b9d404c841e03348e5914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762481045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/627e41c6c9c04da03827dd2b6a5787714df02fc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762481045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/627e41c6c9c04da03827dd2b6a5787714df02fc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762481045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of police and military brutality, ideological extremism, state terrorism, terrorism, murder, guns, illicit substances, use of tobacco, oppression of minorities and marginalized groups, and suicide attempts."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Omenzia...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an elder woman with a dark past in search for her missing family amidst a vampire dictatorship, the Blood Junta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/ecac81ae7f3eeee3797c596b640df37c.avif?t=1762481045\" width=363 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A city run by blood-suckers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your criminal records and return from exile to Bah\u00eda Blanca, a city on the verge of civil strife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/8887bcfc274e42284cfc8e87f3dd763b.avif?t=1762481045\" width=1095 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you join the revolution?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Junta opresses humanity with the Blood Tribute, indebting them with their own life-force, but the Dead Hand revolutionaries seek to throw down their dominion by any means necessary. Will you join them or give them away